<title>HONG KONG: Singapore Airlines appoints new HK manager.</title>
<headline>Singapore Airlines appoints new HK manager.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Airlines said it appointed Tan Tiow Kor as general manager Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Tan, previously general manager in Thailand, replaces C.K.Lee who is returning to the airline's home base as general manager Singapore.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
